# What a method of a list as made and Array.from make is a list itself: under a key that is a number or undefined the list itself stays in sight. A list that went out takes the road of strangers.
# L0 .. L5 = the six classes, L6 = Out, whose list is handed out. flat is not among them: it asks whatever it reaches whether it is a list, so what it reaches goes out whatever the new list is.
# RUN: link layouts mechanisms=all
# CHECK: layout L0 changes=[] stays-with-compiled-code
# CHECK: layout L1 changes=[] stays-with-compiled-code
# CHECK: layout L2 changes=[] stays-with-compiled-code
# CHECK: layout L3 changes=[] stays-with-compiled-code
# CHECK: layout L4 changes=[] stays-with-compiled-code
# CHECK: layout L5 changes=[] stays-with-compiled-code
# RUN(OUT): link layouts mechanisms=all
# OUT-NOT: layout L6 changes=[] stays-with-compiled-code
